  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The protracted conflict in different parts of Nigeria continues to devastate the lives of millions of Nigerians resulting in a serious humanitarian crisis across the country. In addition, many communities in Nigeria are prone to flood and other natural disasters which affects an average of 4 million Nigerians each year. This project hopes provide emergency humanitarian support to cushion any hardship faced by the victims to restore their human dignity and livelihood.</narrative>
  </description>
